{"id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-tree.md","title":"Tree","display":"df-tree — Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tree","aliases":["58-df-tree"],"display":"df-tree — Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree — Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,t\\in V\">\\(T,R,t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}predecessors}\\vdash\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}predecessors}\\vdash\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(T,R)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\Bigl((R\\cap(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\times\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)))\\setminus\\Delta_{\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)},\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(T,R)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\Bigl((R\\cap(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\times\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)))\\setminus\\Delta_{\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)},\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The diagonal is removed because the poset relation is reflexive while the upstream well-order predicate is strict.</li>\n<li>前驱集合已成为显式三元构造；不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\">\\(P_t\\)</span> 的定义悬挂在主公式之后。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}predecessors}\\vdash\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(T,R)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\Bigl((R\\cap(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\times\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)))\\setminus\\Delta_{\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)},\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"P_t","display":false}],"bytes":1172,"backlinks":[{"id":"091259c83b563d39","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)$ (tree predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]])"},{"id":"15016c1e1dd